        "7dce2a2f-2ef5-43fc-b9a1-f0bcc76544c9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“It was fucking epic! If you don’t go, you’ll regret it. <br/>For real, the view alone is worth the entire price. If you go to Norway without this group, you’ll still never get to have the unforgettable experiences you’ll have at the Viking Initiation. The unique activities we got to do were unreal!”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/MGL1256_SM.png",
            "author": "Ian Stanley",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“During this event, it filled me with great pride and honor to see the wisdom and ways of the Old Norse come alive in the lives of all of those in attendance. </p><p>If you seek an adventure that will change your life, help you to find renewed passion, and initiate a connection to the wisdom of the past, then this is for you! I highly recommend \"The Viking Initiation Adventure\" for anyone ready to amp up every area of their life.\"</p><p></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CS_01048.jpg",
            "author": "Kaedrich Olsen",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“The Viking Initiation is a world class event that was truly a unique and unforgettable experience in an absolutely beautiful and breath-taking part of the world. From the location, to the teachers, to the authentic immersion into the Viking life and history, they thought of everything and organized it perfectly.”</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Karl.jpg",
            "author": "Karl Larsen",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
