    "a9222eb4-8d59-40cd-9ce4-bad54c0c56ad": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/PHOTO-2021-10-31-18-06-28.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Meet Your Hosts",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h4>AARON JAMES YAGER, Founder</h4><p>Eden, Utah - An entrepreneur since he was 10 years old. He is here to inspire others to greatness, by providing a loving & safe container.  His character is one of bravery, reliability, trustworthiness, and is fiercely protective yet unconditionally loving and supportive. He is a leading expert in Mindset & Emotional Optimization for High Performers. He capitalizes on the power of hypnotherapy & NLP to help his clients eliminate neglect, break through plateaus, and unlock deeper levels of happiness and fulfillment. He is a passionate world-traveler (been to over 33 countries) and is a proud Viking enthusiast. </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_rGXDqY": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC01678_1.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h4><strong>TOM AGUIRRE,  </strong>Co-Host</h4><p>Kristiansand, Norway - A Norwegian martial artist, film producer, actor and influencer. Lives in and grew up in the magical fjords of the western part of Norway. He has been building  companies for the last 25 years, and now helps companies to reach their sales goals. He just launched a new Mead Brewery called VIKINGR MEAD. He’s skilled in the martial art of Kail (knifes, sticks, empty hands), Brazilian Jiu Jitsu, and also sword and axe fighting. He’s a historical nerd within the Viking areas of viking black-smithing, woodworking, hand-carvings, and traditional building of equipment and cabins.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "1",
        "show_wave": true,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_JPgmwm": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ash_Bio.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Learn From Incredible Experts",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Essence of Ash</strong></h3><p>Ash is an Archaeologist, Völva (a female practitioner of magic divination and prophecy), Artist, and Facilitator of Northern Sorcery. The old magic traditions of Scandinavia, and the wisdom of the wilderness are her sources of inspiration. <br/><br/>Her journey with the runes began over eleven years ago as a way to deepen connection to Norwegian roots. Ash’s teachings revolve around daily practice, ceremony, and nurturing relationships with Norse gods and goddesses. <br/><br/>She provides mentorship, divination, hand-poke tattoos, and crafted ritual tools. Her work is grounded in respect, integrity and awe for the primal power of the runes.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_GJCWXG": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/CS_01048.jpg",
        "image_mask": "rounded",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<h3><strong>Kaedrich Olsen</strong></h3><p>Kaedrich Olsen, <strong>seen on </strong><em><strong>Gaia</strong></em><strong> shows</strong>, is an internationally renowned author, speaker, and teacher who specializes in divergent paths of spiritual growth.</p><p>Author of Runes for Transformation, published by Red Wheel/ Weiser, taps into the depths of your mind to connect with the runes within, to bring change into the world around you. Founder and composer of GaldraKraft: combining runes, ritual, music and magic for an immersive experience in the power of rune song.</p><p>From seances at an early age, to a lifetime of esoteric practices (including runes and Norse mysticism), he is ideally suited to help you discover your own sacred path through life, and beyond.</p><p>His offerings include: Spiritual Guidance, Pagan Men’s Spirituality, Shadow Work & Paranormal Arts Training </p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "left",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "show_wave": false,
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
